00:08:30.491 --> 00:08:33.164
KATIE MCLAUGHLIN: Mhm.

00:08:33.164 --> 00:08:34.039
MARTIN OMANDER: Yeah.

00:08:34.039 --> 00:08:35.030
The cats are back.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:38.360
Oh, I love this, how if anything
went awry with the service,

00:08:38.360 --> 00:08:40.377
