00:08:40.377 --> 00:08:42.710
KATIE MCLAUGHLIN: That's one
of the powers of Terraform.

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.020
Now, there are some
limitations to how much

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:47.930
Terraform can save you from
misconfigured projects.

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:52.220
But this is an example of how
Terraform can recreate some

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:55.670
of these resources for you.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.990
MARTIN OMANDER: Ah, right.

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:58.280
Cool.

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:02.450
I have to keep on entering
